em bring nuance to their reading and writing of texts. We strongly believe that the interdisciplinary approach, which we emphasize in our teaching is highly enriching for literary studies, including Assamese.\nFaculty Members\nDR SUDAKSHANA GOGOI\nAssistant Professor\n8638736724\nsudakshanagogoi@gmail.com\nView Profile\nDR HIMADRI DUTTA\nAssistant Professor\n6000602709\nhrididbc@gmail.com\nView Profile\nActivities\nID\nTitle\nDescription\nPublish\nFile\nAchievements\nID\nTitle\nDate\nView\nQuestion\nID\nPaper Code\nSemester\nYear\nView\nSyllabus\nID\nTitle\nDate\nView\n9\nSyllabus: FYUG (Assamese)\n2025-03-07\nView File\nMagazine/Book\nID\nTitle\nCover\nFile\nDepartmental Events\nTitle\nDescription\nDate\nFile\nAbout\nResults\nEvents\nStaff Login\nTenders\nGallery\nIQAC\nAQARs\nGauhati University\nAssam University\nUGC\nNAAC\nGMDC, Diblong\nDima Hasao, Assam, 788832\nGMDC, DIBLONG\nPowered by:\nS.S. Technologies", "links": [{"label": "", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/index.php"}, {"label": "GMDC, DIBLONG", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/index.php"}, {"label": "About College", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/about.php"}, {"label": "Mission & Vision", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/Academic-Departmentsnew.php?department=e5bcac3a240aa9e58d6bcd72b6099a6eb9513bfe3bb247d9f183cca5ba81f018ea02067e464a511c579e9220fd323d2e0a446e8f99058952cfb9f047d7daf871"}, {"label": "Prospectus", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/Prospectus GMDC 2024-25.pdf"}, {"label": "Governing body", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/governingbody.php"}, {"label": "Principal", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/principal.php"}, {"label": "Teaching Staff", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/teachingstaff.php"}, {"label": "Non-Teaching Staff", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/non-teachingstaff.php"}, {"label": "Intake Capacity", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/intakecapacity.php"}, {"label": "Courses Offered", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/coursesoffered.php"}, {"label": "Eligibility for A